{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02731","headline":"八咏应制二首 一 · 上官仪","name":"八咏应制二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"啓重帷，重帷照文杏。\n翡翠藻轻花，流苏媚浮影。\n瑶笙燕始归，金堂露初曦。\n风随少女至，虹共美人归。\n罗荐已擘鸳鸯被，绮衣复有蒲萄带。\n残红艳粉映帘中，戏蝶流莺聚窗外。\n洛滨春雪回，巫峡暮云来。\n雪花飘玉辇，云光上璧台。\n共待新妆出，清歌送落梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"上官仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}